WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.160
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.430 --> 00:17.510
[Eita, I entrust this to you] [The truth, of the day I broke]

3
00:17.510 --> 00:18.510
[But the key to 203] [is the one thing I can't give you]

4
01:02.670 --> 01:06.700
I'm sorry about yesterday.

5
01:06.700 --> 01:09.010
Don't apologize.

6
01:11.490 --> 01:15.620
You should try making that soup from yesterday.

7
01:16.540 --> 01:17.560
Huh?

8
01:17.560 --> 01:20.380
If it's your recipe, I'd love to try it.

9
01:36.550 --> 01:38.070
Today's your day off, right?

10
01:38.070 --> 01:40.860
- Yeah. - Relax, and take it easy.

11
01:40.860 --> 01:43.650
- See you later. - See you.

12
01:45.370 --> 01:52.150
[These are sketches you left behind] [I couldn't throw them away]

13
02:15.980 --> 02:18.450
I drew this?

14
02:28.540 --> 02:30.660
Hello?

15
02:30.660 --> 02:32.790
Did you get the package?

16
02:32.790 --> 02:36.220
Yeah. Did I draw all of these?

17
02:36.220 --> 02:41.220
Yup. Seems like the manager held onto them for you.

18
02:42.470 --> 02:46.000
How are things going with Eita?

19
02:46.000 --> 02:49.040
You two are getting married soon, right?

20
02:49.040 --> 02:51.580
We haven't talked about that yet.

21
02:52.170 --> 02:53.810
Why not?

22
02:53.810 --> 02:57.630
Eita's dependable, and has a stable future.

23
02:57.630 --> 03:00.680
He understands and cares for you as well.

24
03:02.180 --> 03:04.160
Mom.

25
03:05.520 --> 03:08.320
I had gotten into an accident, right?

26
03:08.320 --> 03:10.410
With a man named Lun.

27
03:10.410 --> 03:12.930
Who told you?

28
03:12.930 --> 03:15.130
You knew.

29
03:15.130 --> 03:18.710
Sakura. You don't have to remember, okay?

30
03:18.710 --> 03:20.850
Why?

31
03:20.850 --> 03:27.330
You don't know what it was like for you after the accident.

32
03:28.050 --> 03:30.740
You'd call me night after night,

33
03:30.740 --> 03:33.460
crying about how you couldn't breathe.

34
03:33.460 --> 03:38.090
Only to forget you called by the next morning.

35
03:39.720 --> 03:42.930
But... But these are my memories.

36
03:42.930 --> 03:44.820
Exactly.

37
03:44.820 --> 03:49.070
You said it yourself. That you didn't want to remember.

38
03:50.000 --> 03:55.370
Eita was there for you the entire time.

39
03:58.180 --> 04:01.310
Are you saying I should entrust everything to Eita?

40
04:01.310 --> 04:06.740
Not everyone is so blessed to have someone like that in their life.

41
04:12.980 --> 04:14.970
I know.

42
04:29.010 --> 04:32.350
You haven't gotten any work done.

43
04:32.350 --> 04:33.910
Were you watching?

44
04:33.910 --> 04:36.040
I don't need to watch to tell.

45
04:38.370 --> 04:40.420
So you didn't give it to her.

46
04:41.580 --> 04:43.650
I couldn't.

47
04:44.630 --> 04:46.550
I see.

48
04:48.560 --> 04:51.500
Maybe I'll just put it in a safe.

49
04:51.500 --> 04:53.130
What?

50
04:53.130 --> 04:55.610
If I have it on hand, I'll be tempted to give it to her.

51
04:56.380 --> 04:58.560
You don't want to give it to her?

52
05:00.320 --> 05:02.040
I don't know.

53
05:02.740 --> 05:05.130
I don't get you sometimes.

54
05:14.650 --> 05:18.070
What would you do, Natsume? Would you pull back?

55
05:19.670 --> 05:23.650
I'd tell them not to go.

56
05:23.650 --> 05:25.100
What?

57
05:25.100 --> 05:30.040
I wouldn't be able to tell someone I love that they were free to go wherever.

58
05:31.770 --> 05:34.010
Most people would agree.

59
05:35.180 --> 05:36.630
[White pepper soup, only on rainy days]

60
05:36.630 --> 05:39.000
I'm not doing this to remember.

61
05:40.780 --> 05:42.740
I'm doing this for closure.

62
05:47.820 --> 05:50.730
Today is special secret recipe!

63
05:50.730 --> 05:54.070
What? You said yesterday was secret.

64
05:54.070 --> 05:56.400
Today is very secret!

65
05:56.400 --> 05:59.460
Okay, okay. Really secret. I won't ask.

66
05:59.460 --> 06:02.180
The secret is...

67
06:03.100 --> 06:04.710
Huh?

68
06:04.710 --> 06:06.630
Now I know everything!

69
06:06.630 --> 06:08.410
Forget it!

70
06:08.410 --> 06:10.590
Nope. Nuh-uh.

71
06:10.590 --> 06:13.090
I remember now.

72
06:24.120 --> 06:27.020
I just wanted to end things.

73
06:35.970 --> 06:41.120
[Eita: I'll be coming home earlier today]

74
06:41.120 --> 06:45.410
[Is there anything you want to eat?]

75
06:45.410 --> 06:49.980
[I made soup]

76
06:56.640 --> 07:01.610
[Don't leave the vase empty]

77
07:20.850 --> 07:22.840
You didn't erase it.

78
07:26.610 --> 07:28.650
If I did,

79
07:30.500 --> 07:32.680
I'd only draw it again.

80
07:45.310 --> 07:46.710
Lei.

81
07:50.030 --> 07:54.780
I want you to hold onto this for me.

82
07:55.580 --> 07:59.190
You're going to use me, to stop yourself from seeing her?

83
07:59.190 --> 08:00.800
No.

84
08:01.980 --> 08:04.560
I just don't want to hurt you anymore.

85
08:10.160 --> 08:12.270
Does that mean...

86
08:21.670 --> 08:23.620
You chose me?

87
08:55.770 --> 08:57.360
Lun.

88
09:08.850 --> 09:10.630
I love you.

89
09:34.920 --> 09:37.690
But I'm no replacement for someone you want to forget.

90
09:41.160 --> 09:43.450
Hold onto this key yourself.

91
09:56.870 --> 10:00.620
Yesterday, I bumped into her fiancé at 203.

92
10:02.230 --> 10:04.220
All these years,

93
10:06.070 --> 10:08.220
I thought she cast you aside.

94
10:09.640 --> 10:11.390
But I was wrong.

95
10:12.420 --> 10:15.860
After the accident, she had slowly forgotten all her memories with you.

96
10:18.490 --> 10:20.240
What?

97
10:29.380 --> 10:34.650
Is it my fault she forgot?

98
10:35.920 --> 10:37.950
I don't know.

99
10:40.390 --> 10:42.320
Go find that answer yourself.

100
10:42.930 --> 10:45.690
Why do you still encourage me to look for her?

101
10:46.670 --> 10:48.500
I...

102
10:50.690 --> 10:54.620
I don't want to be your choice,

103
10:55.320 --> 10:57.470
while you still know nothing.

104
10:59.240 --> 11:01.640
If you want to end things,

105
11:03.350 --> 11:05.800
end them on your own terms.

106
11:08.350 --> 11:10.090
Then, once you're ready,

107
11:13.320 --> 11:15.250
come back to me,

108
11:16.780 --> 11:18.420
and give me your answer.

109
11:41.050 --> 11:43.020
- Hello! - Hello.

110
11:43.020 --> 11:45.570
Are you looking for something?

111
11:45.570 --> 11:48.820
This one is popular. Would you like to take a look?

112
11:51.250 --> 11:52.900
Oh, do you want a Eustoma​?

113
11:52.900 --> 11:55.110
- Yes. - Sure!

114
11:55.110 --> 11:58.670
I'm only going to leave these. I won't see him.

115
12:12.030 --> 12:15.000
[Eita: Just finished work, heading back now]

116
12:15.000 --> 12:21.910
[Okay, I'll be waiting]

117
12:22.930 --> 12:24.810
I have to get home.

118
12:34.600 --> 12:35.990
Lun.

119
12:44.960 --> 12:46.670
Why are you here?

120
13:10.340 --> 13:12.950
I came to leave the keys behind.

121
13:14.380 --> 13:17.010
We came to end this.

122
13:17.010 --> 13:18.450
Yeah.

123
13:30.210 --> 13:32.660
I'll go back to Eita.

124
13:33.780 --> 13:36.120
You go back to Lei.

125
13:36.120 --> 13:37.580
Yeah.

126
13:38.770 --> 13:41.390
I have to go back to her.

127
13:41.390 --> 13:43.140
We have to.

128
13:52.190 --> 13:56.720
I... didn't want to see you.

129
13:56.720 --> 13:58.100
I know.

130
13:59.280 --> 14:03.450
I really... didn't want to see you.

131
14:05.590 --> 14:06.990
Yeah.

132
14:08.150 --> 14:09.770
But...

133
14:11.520 --> 14:13.810
I wanted to see you.

134
14:15.220 --> 14:19.430
Now, I don't know where to go.

135
14:28.820 --> 14:32.040
I don't know either.

136
14:34.130 --> 14:37.970
But I want to know who you are now.

137
14:37.970 --> 14:39.770
Did you remember?

138
14:39.770 --> 14:41.190
No.

139
14:44.380 --> 14:46.470
It's not that I remember.

140
15:47.080 --> 15:54.970
[Eita: I just got back, where are you?]

141
16:00.190 --> 16:04.490
[Eita, Location]

142
16:05.970 --> 16:09.730
[You've stopped sharing your location with this individual]

143
16:15.520 --> 16:22.290
[Eita: I'll heat up your soup for us]

144
16:26.680 --> 16:28.380
You okay?

145
16:28.380 --> 16:29.740
Yeah.

146
17:17.150 --> 17:21.210
I'll leave the door open when I'm home.

147
19:00.830 --> 19:02.940
At the zoo...

148
19:02.940 --> 19:04.580
Yeah?

149
19:04.580 --> 19:09.560
One animal went outside, but ran right back.

150
19:10.820 --> 19:13.560
Because it was scared?

151
19:13.560 --> 19:14.990
Yeah.

152
19:16.150 --> 19:20.600
But once they knew outside, going back is different.

153
19:21.850 --> 19:23.420
You too?

154
19:25.230 --> 19:26.830
I don't know.

155
19:28.810 --> 19:30.620
Sakura...

156
19:31.540 --> 19:37.130
You won't suddenly disappear, right?

157
20:12.500 --> 20:15.530
[Eita Nishikido]

158
20:51.960 --> 20:53.550
Don't move.

159
21:13.450 --> 21:15.380
I know this.

160
21:20.070 --> 21:22.180
Sakura?

161
21:22.180 --> 21:24.140
Don't come any closer.

162
21:27.050 --> 21:28.840
I'm sorry.

163
21:47.640 --> 21:50.560
- Sakura... - Don't touch me!

164
23:01.570 --> 23:09.330
[Next]
